WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.061
Week 26: Conditional, Courtesy, and Hypothesis. make a tactful request evaluate options state hypothetical consequences

2
00:00:09.061 --> 00:00:16.948
Mission brief. Recommend one of three plans under uncertain conditions and respond to objections tactfully.

3
00:00:16.948 --> 00:00:26.566
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:26.566 --> 00:00:34.581
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:34.581 --> 00:00:43.322
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:43.322 --> 00:01:12.695
Model language. Voy a recomendar uno de tres planes. — I am going to recommend one of three plans. Explico la incertidumbre de cada opción. — I explain the uncertainty of each option. Respondo a cada objeción con tacto. — I respond to each objection tactfully. Justifico mi elección con datos. — I justify my choice with data. Al final, propongo un plan claro. — In the end, I propose a clear plan.

7
00:01:12.695 --> 00:01:22.849
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
